@startuml
title Staff Member Class State Machine Diagram

state Unassigned
state AssignedToClient
state AssignedToCampaign
state Unemployed
state Archived

[*] --> LoggedIn
LoggedIn --> Assign : assignStaffMember
Assign --> Combined_Assign : assignedToClient, assignedToCampaign
Combined_Assign --> AssignedToClient : assignedToClient
Combined_Assign --> AssignedToCampaign : assignedToCampaign

AssignedToClient --> SwitchAssignment : switchAssignment
SwitchAssignment --> Unassigned

AssignedToCampaign --> SwitchAssignment : switchAssignment
SwitchAssignment --> Unassigned

Unassigned --> RemoveAssignment : removeAssignment
RemoveAssignment --> Unemployed

Unemployed --> LeaveJob : leaveJob
LeaveJob --> Unemployed

Unemployed --> Archive : archiveRecord
Archive --> Archived

AssignedToClient, AssignedToCampaign --> [*] : COMPLETION_EVENT
@enduml
